                    45.0,
                    449.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(b) Such leaves of absence by the joint and mutual consent of both Company and Union may be reviewed and extended for additional periods of one (1) year each, subject to the conditions of Section 14 (a) above.",
            "block_bbox": [
                44,
                455,
