        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(c) Maternity leave shall be granted without pay to full time employees provided that they return to work no later than three (3) months following birth or miscarriage, and must have been continuously employed for one (1) year; and provided that written application for leave is made to and approved by the Division Manager.",
